  "hint.brExtra": ["閉じるほうが 1 つ多いです。開いた数と同じだけ閉じます。", "One too many closing marks. Close exactly as many as you opened."],
  "hint.brMismatch": ["開いた形と閉じた形が違います。( は ) で、[ は ] で閉じます。", "The shapes don't match. ( closes with ), [ closes with ]."],
  "hint.brUnclosed": ["開いたままです。行の終わりまでに閉じます。", "Still open. Close it before the end."],
